[[3,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2892035\">7005D22</a>\n                                           (rear\nguide)</p><p>1. Disconnect the electrical connections from the door lock (1a),\nthe electric windows motor (1b) and the rear view mirror (1c).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1a</p></td><td><p>Front door lock gear motor left</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890908\">N50</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1a</p></td><td><p>Front door lock gear motor right</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890912\">N51</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Front electric window motor left</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890924\">N60</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Front electric window motor right</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890929\">N61</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1c</p></td><td><p>Left door mirror</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2891084\">P60</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1c</p></td><td><p>Right door mirror</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2891089\">P61</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Disconnect the door wiring electrical connection.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Front door junction left</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890117\">D30</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Front door junction right</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890129\">D31</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>3. Disconnect the cable loom retaining springs from the door.</p><p>4. Extract the cable loom from the door frame.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2035359.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[3,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the wiring is undamaged\nand that the individual conductors are firmly attached to the connections.</p><p>Check that the connections are fitted with\nanti-slip devices (secondary lock).</p><p>If necessary, check the continuity.</p><p>Insert the cable loom in its housing inside\nthe door housing.</p><p>Attach the cable loom retaining springs\nto the door frame.</p><p>Connect the electrical connections.</p><p>Check the operation of the electrical components\nconnected.</p><p><a href=\"#/2892035\">7005D22</a>\n                                           (rear\nguide)</p>"]]